  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Oparam@Papu S/O Ramchandra B/C Vishnoi vs State Of Rajasthan on 12 December, 2019 Author: Pankaj Bhandari Bench: Pankaj Bhandari High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Criminal Miscellaneous Bail Application No. 17060/2019 Oparam@papu S/o Ramchandra B/c Vishnoi, R/o Jalamarliya Ps Bhopalgarh Dist. Jodhpur Raj. (At Present Petitioner Is Confined In Sub Jail Neemkathana Sikar) ----Petitioner Versus State Of Rajasthan, Through Pp ----Respondent For Petitioner(s) : Mr. Om Prakash For State : Mr. Mangal Singh Saini, Pp Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Pankaj Bhandari Order 12/12/2019 1 . Petitioner has filed this bail application under Section 439 of Cr.P.C. 2.",
    "facts": "1 . Petitioner has filed this bail application under Section 439 of Cr.P.C. 2. F.I.R. No. 511/19 was registered at Police Station Srimadhopur Distt. Sikar for offence under Sections 420, 407, 379, 272, 273, 120-B of I.P.C. and Section 51, 52 and 57 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. It is contended by counsel for the petitioner that matter pertains to stealing of milk from tanker. Petitioner is not having criminal antecedents. 4. Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the bail application.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. It is contended by counsel for the petitioner that matter pertains to stealing of milk from tanker.",
    "respondent_arguments": "Petitioner is not having criminal antecedents. 4. Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the bail application.",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
